<title>ESTONIA: HANSAPANK INSURANCE MAY PREMIUMS 406,000 KROONS.</title>
<headline>HANSAPANK INSURANCE MAY PREMIUMS 406,000 KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank Insurance collected 406,000 kroons in premiums in May, it said on Friday.</p>
<p>The insurance subsidary of Hansapank has collected 1.65 million kroons in premiums from the beginning of the year, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>The company paid out 14,000 kroons in May. For the first five months of the year, the figure is 160,000 kroons.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
